~ start

Nyan: It's time to grow your first crop.
Nyan: Harvest 5 Corn and bring them back to me.

=> END


~ progress

Nyan: Keep going!
Nyan: I need 5 Corn before we can continue restoring Harvestia.

=> END


~ turn_in

Nyan: Wonderful work!

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Nyan: These Corn will keep our animals fed.

Nyan: Here is your reward.

=> END


~ completed

Nyan: Thanks again.
Nyan: We can now move on to the next task.

=> END